{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/JoinOurDiscord.png?t=1737758940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/FoobarSteamTitles-01.png?t=1737758940\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Fast paced action, with dynamic movement such as walljumps and dodges </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 6v6 team based PvP, or 12 player free for all</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Customizable loadout, with 3 weapons 3 skill slots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiple gamemodes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Anime aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Customizable outfits for your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Futuristic virtual world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Foobar Zero is set in a world where the virtual reality has reached such a level, where it is possible to fully immerse and control your game avatar. In this game, you are controlling such an avatar, and combatting other players in a simulation. The area of the combat is replicated from old records, currently available locations, and even fictional locations, like an alien ship! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/FoobarSteamTitles-02.png?t=1737758940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/CustomizeCharacter.gif?t=1737758940\" />Check out the in-game shop where you can purchase various outfits for your character! You can mix them together however you want, and choose the color you like, to express your own style. These are pure cosmetics and doesn't affect the gameplay to keep it balanced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/FoobarSteamTitles-03.png?t=1737758940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/720x1920_KeepMoving_1.gif?t=1737758940\" />You won't last long if you stand still. Use the covers, dodge the attacks, and walljump your way to victory! Practice your skills on the different maps, to learn all the jumps and tricks you can do. Nobody will be able to stop you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/FoobarSteamTitles-04.png?t=1737758940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/720x1920_IntenseMeleeCombat.gif?t=1737758940\" />With the various melee weapons in game, you can find your favourite. Do you prefer faster attacks? Power Katana is the perfect one for you! Are you more tactical, you want to wait around the corner, or predict your enemy's movement? Rocket Fists will deliver powerful attacks but each one has to be charged up. Try them all out, and you will find what is best for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/FoobarSteamTitles-05.png?t=1737758940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/720x1920_UltimateAbilities.gif?t=1737758940\" />Each loadout have 3 skills. One passive, one active, and one ultimate. Ultimates need to be charged up, but when it's usable, they have high impact. Use Bubble Shield to protect your party from any damage, or Tornado, to demolish anyone close to the impact!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/FoobarSteamTitles-06.png?t=1737758940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/ClassicalMultiplayer.gif?t=1737758940\" />Return to the roots of multiplayer gaming! Create your own room, select game mode, map, and other settings, and start your own game! Play multiple rounds with the same people if you want, or choose a different, the choice is in your hands!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2841320?t=1737758940","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2841320?t=1737758940","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/19e558d86913558f553c771d1f3192d44e34286b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1737758940","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/19e558d86913558f553c771d1f3192d44e34286b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1737758940","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/JoinOurDiscord.png?t=1737758940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/FoobarSteamTitles-01.png?t=1737758940\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Fast paced action, with dynamic movement such as walljumps and dodges </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 6v6 team based PvP, or 12 player free for all</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Customizable loadout, with 3 weapons 3 skill slots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiple gamemodes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Anime aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Customizable outfits for your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Futuristic virtual world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Foobar Zero is set in a world where the virtual reality has reached such a level, where it is possible to fully immerse and control your game avatar. In this game, you are controlling such an avatar, and combatting other players in a simulation. The area of the combat is replicated from old records, currently available locations, and even fictional locations, like an alien ship! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/FoobarSteamTitles-02.png?t=1737758940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/CustomizeCharacter.gif?t=1737758940\" />Check out the in-game shop where you can purchase various outfits for your character! You can mix them together however you want, and choose the color you like, to express your own style. These are pure cosmetics and doesn't affect the gameplay to keep it balanced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/FoobarSteamTitles-03.png?t=1737758940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/720x1920_KeepMoving_1.gif?t=1737758940\" />You won't last long if you stand still. Use the covers, dodge the attacks, and walljump your way to victory! Practice your skills on the different maps, to learn all the jumps and tricks you can do. Nobody will be able to stop you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/FoobarSteamTitles-04.png?t=1737758940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/720x1920_IntenseMeleeCombat.gif?t=1737758940\" />With the various melee weapons in game, you can find your favourite. Do you prefer faster attacks? Power Katana is the perfect one for you! Are you more tactical, you want to wait around the corner, or predict your enemy's movement? Rocket Fists will deliver powerful attacks but each one has to be charged up. Try them all out, and you will find what is best for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/FoobarSteamTitles-05.png?t=1737758940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/720x1920_UltimateAbilities.gif?t=1737758940\" />Each loadout have 3 skills. One passive, one active, and one ultimate. Ultimates need to be charged up, but when it's usable, they have high impact. Use Bubble Shield to protect your party from any damage, or Tornado, to demolish anyone close to the impact!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/FoobarSteamTitles-06.png?t=1737758940\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841320/extras/ClassicalMultiplayer.gif?t=1737758940\" />Return to the roots of multiplayer gaming! Create your own room, select game mode, map, and other settings, and start your own game! Play multiple rounds with the same people if you want, or choose a different, the choice is in your hands!</p>","developers":["Foobar Zero Development Team"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Foobar Account (Supports Linking to Steam Account)",